  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Prevention and Response to SGBV Victims in Eastern DRC</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of this project is to help reducing the impact  in eastern DRC of sexual and gender-based violence as well as the threats of child protection within the population affected by armed conflicts, insecurity and ethnic conflicts in Masisi and Walikale territories, especially in Mweso and Pinga health zones in North Kivu province</narrative>
  </description>
